{
  "id": "62",
  "title": "挈要捷驰玄妙诀",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“挈要捷驰玄妙诀”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "以日为主，专论财官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-e9d0cb2af503cd619532-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "盖，官乃为扶身之本，财为养命之源。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-0ebe366894ea7feb375d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "故推天时，察地利，约太过而不及，以中和而为用；去留舒配而中理，轻重强弱而表正。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-fc57fadf62a60e651304-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "先观节气之深浅，后论财官之向背。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-149ea60f14154d69d0f3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "人之命内，皆不离乎财官；诸格局中，总要虚邀禄马。先贤已成矜式，后学须自变通。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-47ad1b1a47bfae5660f7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "宜向之而运背，决之贫贱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-202adc205efa9e375fc4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "宜背之而运向，断之困弱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-6566d072d001d1f57e61-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "喜生以逢生，贵而可取。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-677b6c5d97815732b9c8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "受剋而值剋，吉而堪言。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-02bf70c8cdf7c46f27e7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "逢官而看财，见财富贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-9dc47104a0ea590d781f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "逢杀而看印，遇印荣华。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-d48938a868b420fb3f7e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "逢印看官而遇官，八而七贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-3c2568c82ae1838a90b6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "逢财看杀原有杀，十有九贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-3ffcf56cb03096d53730-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲乙运入西方，身旺功名可许。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-97601c92a93cb165696d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬癸路经南域，主健为贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-bc7f01a12d02f5fdad41-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印财不宜身旺地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-4f43e98021f58135baff-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神最喜劫财乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-3cf7f240f42dcd5501b5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀混杂，身弱则贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-34b420a61877fb6ea3db-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀两停，合杀为贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-bfb5d0329b2572606c89-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年月官星，早年出仕。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-7af957179f3203160e77-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日时正贵，晚岁得名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-c9bede79670bf96c02e7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "胞胎逢印綬，禄享千钟。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-fdebd8cf707405fb1134-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财气遇长生，田肥万顷。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-8642d57d0a2fcff14a24-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "秋冬官星逢刃伤，存金去火贵无疑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-aa755636e5ddb852cd4b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "腊月伤官喜见官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-0616f207db37c6621631-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "破印重伤而祸死。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-f999a177faf37f805467-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财旺生官者，何贵少而富多？",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-5cbaff27b77ec4f0cebc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官见官者，何官高而财足？",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-d5e64e192469f9de1bb8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "无伤不贵，有病为奇，宜当弃之，理妙于斯，何必外取。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-5ee29a3d3a508c92ee7c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "如，火炎水少遇庚辛，休作身旺官轻而取。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-2f2d19303c47604d55fd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "或，土重木绝逢壬癸，难作身旺官轻而决。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-eea9111d99aa7ea5172c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财轻莫逢劫地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-9718ee05c8758b97cf71-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印多最妙财乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-3c633cee9d7245ba8883-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财旺生官，用赂取贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-f9ccec6e288329e9e9be-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀星制刃，劫宝图名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-2c521a6ccd3ec0678c72-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺偏财何取，必取横财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-f46463ad24207cd7c28c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "主捷正财偏劫，频见妻灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-1d12f48f97bad515dc37-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "劫财阳刃入官杀，臺阁之臣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-809a130863e501333e05-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "归禄倒冲逢刃伤，廊庙之贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-2092a0e330aec628ec8e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺有杀逢印綬，权断之官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-d3bed5df6f5025c8abbe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "主弱逢印见财星，寻常之客。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-31160858f8fd6eb76f34-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃伤官有制，膺职掌于兵刑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-fbc1944b094b247a4c1b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "正官正印无伤，出仕牧其士庶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-6e98c7b327a1eb7cc0fc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财旺稼穡，给餉之官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-e5d7d44cf2fe4e06bbf7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "飞禄朝阳，侍廷之相。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-010c720c1558a4b60a99-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乾坤本清气，畿国之荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-17aba135c2f7c4ae6d22-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "子午为极尊，黄门之贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-330ab338d1b324565d80-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸日癸时兼亥丑，魁名及第入翰林。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-905d8d1a8d8bbe42e989-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬日壬时叠寅辰，高爵承恩登御阁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-2e548425c648d3d87bb4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日德见魁罡，纵吉运，贫寒之士。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-4384e6f81b819668b6d0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "魁罡见财官，任得地，衣禄之人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-5e84b9af482e115aacc4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官见官，妙入财印之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-0e91821a5a692b0b131b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财星破印，贵行比劫之中。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-77f2f93e4e9cfa907ba5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "命逢财，运逢杀，吉而堪言。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-b1a71c58c7e07c2dcd23-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "命逢杀，运逢财，凶而可决。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-11d7fe7cf22a3d512924-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女多伤官，归禄得之极吉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-b5845836af3736d8fb75-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "男逢阳刃，身弱遇之为奇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-5ae4dff167a99034183d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金神、归禄、栏叉，女命逢之最忌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-e5084add941a434538e3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃、伤官、七杀，男子值之得权。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-2a1a5690806d26d85820-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金神入火逢杀刃，贵而无疑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-35a750e2826dbbb1dd35-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀重有印逢食伤，荣而自有。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-b4089fd227fe89ebda71-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "正官无印，居官不显。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-b1e3b78cba6fd21d17b6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃七杀，出牧驰名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-be507db3b6bd1a4820cb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺无依，僧道之例。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-3b1421b032e5ad8c66cd-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "桃花滚浪，娼妓之流。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-0c5f2abbb96a8f1ea954-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金弱火强，土木消溶之匠。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-af1ad71581cb6fd30f7a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土多水浅，行商针线之工。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-5d9ed43ca4009c429980-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五湖云遶，始荣终辱己身贫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-a45e9fdfe0213b51c274-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "遍野桃花，一世风流多酒色。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-4fc26987ebf6be3da8c9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "亡神拱杀，盗贼之徒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-c0c79db69fa93b07a77f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "秀气失时，清名之士。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-c39a4372777310a6ecce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印旺身强多嗜酒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-601bd969fc3c392c3791-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁壬妒合犯淫讹。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-638fac64a0002ecbea97-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身印俱强，平生少病。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-b061bbc698cb2da514e6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天月德助，处世无殃。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-3e8dbb032fc344c892e2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神生旺，胜似财官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-2be27a9c3ceb592cf554-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贵全官杀，有弃命就财、就杀、就官者；有餘富贵，无依专旺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-b3b4847e87fad2d3692b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "绝食、绝财、绝官者，无限贫穷。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-ddf039e1e03ac6133c48-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身弱弃命要无根，官居宰辅。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-3d29bff6d488f24ee8fb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "主衰身化得其时，位近天廷。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-2b939de334bfd758c607-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "男命，类属从化、照返鬼伏；女命，纯和清贵、浊滥淫娼。宜细详之！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "62-d3cb33c6e806bc23a6ed-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
